articles.content_en:
Article 1: The People's Court shall accept the following civil dispute cases arising between equal civil subjects in the reform of the enterprise property rights system:
(1) civil disputes arising from the corporate system reform of enterprises;
(2) civil disputes arising from the joint-stock cooperative system reform of enterprises;
(3) civil disputes arising from the division of enterprises;
(4) disputes over conversion of enterprise creditor's rights into equity;
(5) contract disputes for the sale of enterprises;
(6) contract disputes for the merger of enterprises;
(7) other civil disputes related to enterprise restructuring.
